            "value": "GameTranslator TV uygulaması"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تطبيق GameTranslator للتلفزيون"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator extends Developer Mode by itself each time you use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator extends Developer Mode by itself each time you use it."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator, geliştirici modunun süresini her kullanışınızda kendisi uzatır."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator يمدّد وضع المطوّر تلقائياً في كل مرة تستخدمه."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator is not affiliated with Sony Interactive Entertainment. PlayStation and PS5 are trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator is not affiliated with Sony Interactive Entertainment. PlayStation and PS5 are trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator, Sony Interactive Entertainment ile bağlantılı değildir. PlayStation ve PS5, Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc.'in ticari markalarıdır."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator غير تابع لشركة Sony Interactive Entertainment. PlayStation و PS5 علامتان تجاريتان لشركة Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator reads the English subtitles of your PS5 games and shows a Turkish translation on your TV, on top of the game. You keep playing on the TV with your own controller.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator reads the English subtitles of your PS5 games and shows a Turkish translation on your TV, on top of the game. You keep playing on the TV with your own controller."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator, PS5 oyunlarınızın İngilizce altyazısını okur ve Türkçesini TV'de oyunun üstünde gösterir. Siz TV'de kendi kolunuzla oynamaya devam edersiniz."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator يقرأ الترجمة الإنجليزية لألعاب PS5 ويعرض ترجمة عربية على تلفزيونك فوق اللعبة. تواصل اللعب على التلفزيون بيد التحكم الخاصة بك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator translates on this computer, without the internet. The English–Turkish model (about 530 MB) is downloaded once and kept on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator translates on this computer, without the internet. The English–Turkish model (about 530 MB) is downloaded once and kept on this computer."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator çeviriyi bu bilgisayarda, internetsiz yapar. İngilizce–Türkçe model (yaklaşık 530 MB) bir kez indirilir ve bu bilgisayarda kalır."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "في النسخة العربية تتم الترجمة عبر خدمة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تختارها من الإعدادات، أو بالترجمة المجانية بدون مفتاح."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator watches the game through Remote Play. If it used your own account, the PS5 would turn off your controller. With a second account you keep playing undisturbed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator watches the game through Remote Play. If it used your own account, the PS5 would turn off your controller. With a second account you keep playing undisturbed."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator oyunu Uzaktan Oynatma ile izler. Kendi hesabınızı kullansaydı PS5 kolunuzu kapatırdı. İkinci bir hesapla oyununuz hiç bölünmez."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator يشاهد اللعبة عبر Remote Play. لو استخدم حسابك لأطفأ الـPS5 يد التحكم. بالحساب الثاني تواصل اللعب دون إزعاج."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator will send a sample subtitle to your TV. It should appear at the bottom of the screen, on top of the game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator will send a sample subtitle to your TV. It should appear at the bottom of the screen, on top of the game."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GameTranslator TV'nize örnek bir altyazı gönderecek. Ekranın altında, oyunun üstünde görünmeli."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيرسل GameTranslator ترجمة تجريبية إلى تلفزيونك. يُفترض أن تظهر أسفل الشاشة فوق اللعبة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not download %@. Check the internet connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not download %@. Check the internet connection and try again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ indirilemedi. İnternet bağlantısını denetleyip yeniden deneyin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر تنزيل %@. تحقق من الاتصال بالإنترنت وحاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not translate this area.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not translate this area."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu alan çevrilemedi."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّرت ترجمة هذه المنطقة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a free account at playstation.com with a different email address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a free account at playstation.com with a different email address."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "playstation.com'da farklı bir e-posta adresiyle ücretsiz bir hesap açın."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أنشئ حساباً مجانياً في playstation.com ببريد إلكتروني مختلف."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debugging was not allowed on the TV. Try again and choose Allow on the TV.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Debugging was not allowed on the TV. Try again and choose Allow on the TV."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'de hata ayıklamaya izin verilmedi. Yeniden deneyin ve TV'de İzin ver'i seçin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يُسمح بتصحيح الأخطاء على التلفزيون. حاول مرة أخرى واختر «السماح» على التلفزيون."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer Mode is on. One last step to install the TV app:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Developer Mode is on. One last step to install the TV app:"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geliştirici modu açık. TV uygulamasını kurmak için son bir adım kaldı:"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "وضع المطوّر مفعّل. خطوة أخيرة لتثبيت تطبيق التلفزيون:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer Mode: %lld hours left. GameTranslator extends it by itself each time you use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Developer Mode: %lld hours left. GameTranslator extends it by itself each time you use it."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geliştirici modu: %lld saat kaldı. GameTranslator süreyi her kullanışınızda kendisi uzatır."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "وضع المطوّر: بقي %lld ساعة. GameTranslator يمدّده تلقائياً في كل مرة تستخدمه."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you see it on the TV?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do you see it on the TV?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'de görüyor musunuz?"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "هل تراها على التلفزيون؟"
          }
        }
