            "value": "التلفزيون يقول:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text recognition for the game language is not installed on this computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text recognition for the game language is not installed on this computer."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oyun dilinin yazı tanıma özelliği bu bilgisayarda yüklü değil."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "التعرّف على النص للغة اللعبة غير مثبّت على هذا الكمبيوتر."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text size": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text size"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yazı boyutu"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حجم النص"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@–%@ language pack is not downloaded yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The %@–%@ language pack is not downloaded yet."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@–%@ dil paketi henüz indirilmedi."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حزمة اللغة %@–%@ لم تُنزَّل بعد."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Num shortcuts work only while translating, so the number keys stay free in other apps. Keep Num Lock on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Num shortcuts work only while translating, so the number keys stay free in other apps. Keep Num Lock on."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Num kısayolları yalnız çeviri açıkken çalışır; böylece sayı tuşları diğer uygulamalarda serbest kalır. Num Lock açık olmalı."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اختصارات Num تعمل فقط أثناء الترجمة، فتبقى مفاتيح الأرقام حرة في البرامج الأخرى. أبقِ Num Lock مفعّلاً."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 Remote Play service stopped unexpectedly. Restart the PS5 and enter a new code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The PS5 Remote Play service stopped unexpectedly. Restart the PS5 and enter a new code."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5'in Uzaktan Oynatma hizmeti beklenmedik şekilde durdu. PS5'i yeniden başlatıp yeni kodu girin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "توقفت خدمة Remote Play في الـPS5 فجأة. أعد تشغيل الـPS5 وأدخل رمزاً جديداً."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 did not answer. Make sure it is on (not in rest mode), on the same network as this computer, and that Remote Play is turned on, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The PS5 did not answer. Make sure it is on (not in rest mode), on the same network as this computer, and that Remote Play is turned on, then try again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5 yanıt vermedi. Açık olduğundan (dinlenme modunda olmadığından), bu bilgisayarla aynı ağda bulunduğundan ve Uzaktan Oynatma'nın açık olduğundan emin olup yeniden deneyin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يرد الـPS5. تأكد أنه مشغّل (وليس في وضع الراحة)، وعلى نفس شبكة هذا الكمبيوتر، وأن اللعب عن بُعد مفعّل، ثم حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 did not recognise this account. Get the code from the PS5 user signed in with the account you used in GameTranslator, or sign in again with that user's account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The PS5 did not recognise this account. Get the code from the PS5 user signed in with the account you used in GameTranslator, or sign in again with that user's account."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5 bu hesabı tanımadı. Kodu, GameTranslator'ta giriş yaptığınız hesapla oturum açmış PS5 kullanıcısından alın ya da bir önceki adımda o kullanıcının hesabıyla yeniden giriş yapın."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يتعرّف الـPS5 على هذا الحساب. خذ الرمز من مستخدم الـPS5 المسجّل بالحساب الذي استخدمته في GameTranslator، أو سجّل الدخول من جديد بحساب ذلك المستخدم."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 refused the code. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The PS5 refused the code. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5 kodu kabul etmedi. PS5'te Cihazı Eşleştir'i yeniden açın ve yeni kodu girin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "رفض الـPS5 الرمز. افتح «ربط جهاز» من جديد في الـPS5 وأدخل الرمز الجديد."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 refused the connection. Set up the PS5 again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The PS5 refused the connection. Set up the PS5 again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5 bağlantıyı reddetti. PS5'i yeniden kurun."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "رفض الـPS5 الاتصال. أعد إعداد الـPS5."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app could not be installed. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV app could not be installed. Try again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV uygulaması kurulamadı. Tekrar deneyin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر تثبيت تطبيق التلفزيون. حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV is out of free space. Remove an app you do not use from the TV and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV is out of free space. Remove an app you do not use from the TV and try again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'de boş alan kalmadı. TV'den kullanmadığınız bir uygulamayı kaldırıp tekrar deneyin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا توجد مساحة كافية في التلفزيون. احذف تطبيقاً لا تستخدمه من التلفزيون وحاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app could not be installed. Try again; if it fails again, send us the reason below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV app could not be installed. Try again; if it fails again, send us the reason below."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV uygulaması kurulamadı. Tekrar deneyin; yine olmazsa aşağıdaki sebebi bize gönderin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر تثبيت تطبيق التلفزيون. حاول مرة أخرى؛ وإن فشل ثانية فأرسل لنا السبب الظاهر بالأسفل."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app is not installed. GameTranslator can install it once Developer Mode is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV app is not installed. GameTranslator can install it once Developer Mode is on."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV uygulaması kurulu değil. Geliştirici modu açılınca GameTranslator kendisi kurar."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تطبيق التلفزيون غير مثبّت. GameTranslator يستطيع تثبيته بعد تفعيل وضع المطوّر."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app is not installed. GameTranslator installs it once Developer Mode is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV app is not installed. GameTranslator installs it once Developer Mode is on."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV uygulaması kurulu değil. Geliştirici modu açılınca GameTranslator kendisi kurar."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تطبيق التلفزيون غير مثبّت. GameTranslator يثبّته بعد تفعيل وضع المطوّر."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app is not installed. GameTranslator installs it over the network once debugging is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV app is not installed. GameTranslator installs it over the network once debugging is on."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV uygulaması kurulu değil. Hata ayıklama açılınca GameTranslator ağ üzerinden kendisi kurar."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تطبيق التلفزيون غير مثبّت. GameTranslator يثبّته عبر الشبكة بعد تفعيل تصحيح الأخطاء."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV app is ready (version %@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV app is ready (version %@)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV uygulaması hazır (sürüm %@)."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تطبيق التلفزيون جاهز (الإصدار %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV did not accept this computer. In the TV's Developer Mode window, check that Host PC IP is this computer's address, then restart the TV.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV did not accept this computer. In the TV's Developer Mode window, check that Host PC IP is this computer's address, then restart the TV."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV bu bilgisayarı kabul etmedi. TV'deki geliştirici modu penceresinde Host PC IP'nin bu bilgisayarın adresi olduğunu kontrol edip TV'yi yeniden başlatın."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يقبل التلفزيون هذا الكمبيوتر. في نافذة وضع المطوّر على التلفزيون تأكد أن Host PC IP هو عنوان هذا الكمبيوتر، ثم أعد تشغيل التلفزيون."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV yanıt vermedi. Açık ve aynı ağda olduğundan emin olun."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يرد التلفزيون. تأكد أنه مشغّل وعلى نفس الشبكة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV refused the key. Open Key Server and type the passphrase again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TV refused the key. Open Key Server and type the passphrase again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV anahtarı kabul etmedi. Key Server'ı açıp passphrase'i yeniden yazın."
          }
