    "Turn on the PS5. As the second user, open Settings › System › Remote Play › Pair Device and enter the 8-digit code shown there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on the PS5. As the second user, open Settings › System › Remote Play › Pair Device and enter the 8-digit code shown there."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5'i açın. GameTranslator'ta giriş yaptığınız ikinci hesabın kullanıcısıyla Ayarlar › Sistem › Uzaktan Oynatma › Cihazı Eşleştir'i açın ve orada görünen 8 haneli kodu girin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "شغّل الـPS5. بالمستخدم الثاني افتح الإعدادات › النظام › اللعب عن بُعد › ربط جهاز وأدخل الرمز المكوّن من 8 أرقام الظاهر هناك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the TV. When you press Connect, the TV asks for permission once — accept it with the remote. If the GameTranslator TV app is missing, this screen helps you install it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on the TV. When you press Connect, the TV asks for permission once — accept it with the remote. If the GameTranslator TV app is missing, this screen helps you install it."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'yi açın. Bağlan'a bastığınızda TV bir kez izin ister, kumandayla onaylayın. GameTranslator TV uygulaması kurulu değilse bu ekran kurmanıza yardım eder."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "شغّل التلفزيون. عند الضغط على «اتصال» يطلب التلفزيون الإذن مرة واحدة — اقبله بالريموت. إن لم يكن تطبيق GameTranslator مثبّتاً فهذه الشاشة تساعدك على تثبيته."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on your PS5": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on your PS5"
