    "Your phone reads the English subtitles in the game, translates them and shows them on the TV or on its own screen. You keep playing without putting the controller down.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your phone reads the English subtitles in the game, translates them and shows them on the TV or on its own screen. You keep playing without putting the controller down."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Telefonun oyundaki İngilizce altyazıyı okur, çevirir ve TV'de ya da kendi ekranında gösterir. Sen kumandayı bırakmadan oynarsın."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "جوالك يقرأ الترجمة الإنجليزية في اللعبة ويترجمها ويعرضها على التلفزيون أو على شاشته. تواصل اللعب دون أن تترك يد التحكم."
          }
        }
      }
    },
