          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote Play with your own account would take over your controller and stop your game. With a second, free account the PS5 lets the phone watch the picture while you keep playing on the TV. Create it on the PS5 (Add User) or at playstation.com.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remote Play with your own account would take over your controller and stop your game. With a second, free account the PS5 lets the phone watch the picture while you keep playing on the TV. Create it on the PS5 (Add User) or at playstation.com."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendi hesabınla Uzaktan Oynatma kolunu devralır ve oyununu keser. Ücretsiz ikinci bir hesapla PS5, sen TV'de oynamaya devam ederken telefonun görüntüyü izlemesine izin verir. Hesabı PS5'te (Kullanıcı Ekle) ya da playstation.com'da açabilirsin."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remote Play بحسابك الخاص يأخذ يد التحكم ويوقف لعبك. بحساب ثانٍ مجاني يسمح الـPS5 للجوال بمشاهدة الصورة وأنت تواصل اللعب على التلفزيون. أنشئه من الـPS5 (إضافة مستخدم) أو من playstation.com."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair the PS5": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pair the PS5"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5'i eşle"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اقرن الـPS5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the PS5, with the second account, choose Settings › System › Remote Play › Pair Device and type the code on the screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the PS5, with the second account, choose Settings › System › Remote Play › Pair Device and type the code on the screen."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5'te ikinci hesapla Ayarlar › Sistem › Uzaktan Oynatma › Cihazı Eşle'yi seç, ekrandaki kodu yaz."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "في الـPS5، بالحساب الثاني، اختر الإعدادات › النظام › اللعب عن بُعد › ربط جهاز واكتب الرمز الظاهر على الشاشة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ found": {
